blocks.en:
The main contributions of this work are as follows:
(1) we propose a practical end-to-end multi-camera pipeline for luggage ReID in realistic surveillance environments, explicitly designed for asymmetric enrollment-vs-monitoring scenarios;
(2) we introduce a multi-view and temporal aggregation strategy adapted to the asymmetric nature of our setup, improving robustness to occlusions, missed detections, and fragmented observations;
(3) we conduct extensive experimental and ablation studies, including analyses of camera configurations, shot selection strategies, aggregation mechanism, and cross-dataset adaptation, providing practical insights for real-world deployment of luggage ReID systems.

blocks.zh:
这项工作的主要贡献如下:
(1) 我们提议在现实的监视环境中为行李重新ID建立一个实用的端到端多相机管道,明确用于不对称的入学-Vs监测方案;
( 二 ) 我们 提出 多 观 和 时 候 汇总 战略 , 适应 我们 设置 的 不对称 性质 , 提高 被 隔离 的 稳健性 、 被 发现 和 分散 的 观察 ;
(3)我们进行广泛的实验和消融研究,包括相机配置分析,镜头选择策略,聚合机制,以及跨数据集的适应,为行李再分配系统的实际部署提供实际的见解.
